WEBVTT

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.470
Hey, Ono!

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.210
How's this?

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.500
It looks really good on you.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.400
You'd be hard pressed to find such an amazing garçon on the streets of Paris.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.110
Of course!

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:58.030
And isn't this good too?

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:02.240
I was wondering why you hadn't shaved for several days, but...

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:05.200
I've wanted to do this for quite a while.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.200
I couldn't do it when I was a salesman.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.640
Isn't this cool?

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.670
I think a man should have a beard.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.840
Hey! Don't start thinking anything strange.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:20.800
I won't. My head is preoccupied with opening this shop.

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:24.080
Now I know how to use the equipment you bought.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.770
So from today on, I'll think about the repertoire.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.140
Before that...

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:32.980
How about this?

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.450
Isn't this perfect? Doesn't it look good?

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:43.410
Hiring a cute-looking girl, at a cute age,
anyhow a girl that suits a cute cake shop.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.360
What? You don't like this outfit?

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.580
Sorry, Tachibana.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:56.030
I forgot to tell you, but I'm scared of young women.

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:58.840
I don't think I can work with one in this small shop.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.640
S-Sorry.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.620
Excuse me!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.750
I want to work here!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.140
Hey! Let me go!

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:17.040
What are you doing?!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:17.770
Not yet.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.270
Don't open your eyes yet, Ono!

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.160
Stop playing around!

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:23.180
What kind of interview is this?!

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.490
This is the reason.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.870
It's all right, Ono.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.000
How is he? Is he your type?

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.690
No.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:35.880
All right!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:36.980
You're hired.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.680
What?! I don't understand!

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.560
Sorry. To be honest I'm...

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.880
...gay.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.840
A legendary gay...

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:56.550
Umm... If you don't mind, would you try this?

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:57.980
It's right out of the oven.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.160
Yummy!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:19.340
So yummy!

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.860
If I call what I've been eating till today cake,

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:27.970
I'd have to call this the king of all cakes!

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.110
You're a god!

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:34.630
Please make me your apprentice, boss!

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.790
I won't even mind if you pursue me!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.120
D-Do you like cake that much?

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.160
I love it!

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:42.830
Have you ever studied how to make sweets?

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:43.990
Never.

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:46.940
Well, calm down.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:49.170
What we need is a salesman.

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.240
All you have to do is sell cake.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.730
Shut up, gramps!

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.160
You sell the cakes!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.910
You brat! I'm not going to hire you!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:02.460
I'm the owner! I'm the god of this shop!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.890
Bullshit! In a cake shop, the one who makes the cakes is the god!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.290
Because everything depends on the taste!

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.380
Um...

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:13.260
Tachibana, can't we hire him as an apprentice?

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.170
He said okay.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:29.990
Yes, boss.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.390
Don't call me boss.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.280
Then, how about master?

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:36.790
N-No, I don't like that either.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.500
Then how about sensei?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.180
I'm Eiji, Kanda Eiji.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.710
I can't believe he stayed after that to work.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.230
Wow, amazing!

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:54.520
This is art.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.900
Sensei's choux are pure art.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:58.850
I appreciate your praise...

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:02.150
but the cream filling is now your job.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:03.800
Are you sure?

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.520
Are you sure I can do it?!

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:07.510
Of course.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.660
You're officially my apprentice.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.770
Right, Tachibana?

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.680
However, if you don't learn your work soon, you'll be fired.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.240
We open the day after tomorrow.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:19.410
I don't mind, even if it's tomorrow.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.080
You're quite cocky, brat.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.670
Of course, gramps.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.230
Oh, yeah.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:28.560
Kanda-kun, what were you doing before you came here?

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:30.670
Boxing.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.570
Boxing?

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:38.830
That's why your body is well-knit.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.320
And flexible too.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.190
I've been boxing since I was a kid.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.420
You're still a kid.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:47.040
Anyway, why change from boxing to a cake shop?

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.320
Is it some sort of shattered dream?

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.550
Yeah! What's wrong with that?!

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:55.280
I like cake next best to boxing!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.170
Hey! Drop your chin!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.410
Don't step backwards. Turn!

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.740
Hey, Thunder.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:12.920
What, boss?

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.390
It's about retiring...

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.170
Have you made up your mind yet?

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:27.830
Hey, you should think a bit about your girlfriend.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:30.400
You can't let her support you forever.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.470
Tomorrow's match.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:35.350
If you don't win, you'd better make up your mind.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:38.810
Now! Next!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.580
Shut up, gramps!

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:52.770
You're the one who needs to shut up!

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.260
Now, now.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.240
You'd better understand, gramps!

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.270
I like cake more than any of my meals!

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.430
I'll memorize the names of the cakes in one night!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.190
Don't forget your words.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:13.070
What the hell is this? What language is it?

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:18.280
It's French. Our menu is completely in French.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:24.300
Wow, Tachibana. You're fluent in French, too.

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:25.560
Of course.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.150
You too, sensei?!

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:30.790
Are you still open?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.460
Sorry, Miss.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.010
We don't open until the day after tomorrow.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.450
Oh, that's disappointing.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:39.720
I suddenly wanted something sweet to eat.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:45.560
Then I'll present you a choux à la crème for visiting.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:49.480
That's nice... Thank you, Mr. Cool Garçon.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.800
It's my pleasure.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.560
Now, this way please.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.960
Why has he gone all loopy?

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:00.070
Thank you. I'll come again.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:03.930
I've never seen a cake shop full of so many cool men.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.510
I think this shop will be popular.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.070
Thank you very much.

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:10.260
We await your next visit.

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.340
Thanks.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.460
See you again.

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:21.890
Oh, Tooru!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.260
Namiko.

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:27.230
Look, look, I got some cake.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:35.530
Kanda Eiji!

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:41.080
There's no mistake. You're Kanda Eiji!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.070
Who is it?

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.830
He's a legendary boxer.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:47.060
Light flyweight world champion, and good-looking to boot.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.350
He's called the Idol of the Ring.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:51.710
Oh, the one who's always being featured in boxing magazines?

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.650
A world champion... you?

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:55.910
What's wrong?

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:59.520
You've had quite a career, Kanda-kun.

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:00.880
Well, it's over.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.050
Why?

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:08.980
Why is that Kanda Eiji wearing an apron and working at a cake shop?

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:10.620
What's it to you?

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.790
I'm disappointed.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.530
Why of all things a cake shop?

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:17.050
How is that useful for a man?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:18.550
Are you trying to pick a fight?

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.320
Now, now, you two.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.700
Stop it, Tooru.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.360
Stop it. Not in front of the shop!

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:28.420
Well, sir, do you dislike cake?

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.940
We have many nice cakes.

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:31.790
Please come back when you aren't on a diet.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.090
Like a boxer could eat cakes. Get out of my way!

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:38.960
Hey, Tooru.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:42.630
Sorry. I'll come again, Idol of the Ring-kun.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.010
Wait!

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.990
That made me feel bad.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.430
How can he bad-mouth a cake shop?

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:53.080
I think... he admired you, Kanda-kun.

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:59.810
Surely he'd be disappointed that someone he admired as a gifted boxer is now wearing an apron and working at a cake shop.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:03.450
Shut up! Then why are you running a cake shop?!

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:08.830
Come to think of it, why are you?

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:13.000
From what I've seen these past few days,
it seems you don't like cake.

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.560
To be honest, I hate it.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.660
But a cake shop's customers are mostly women.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.510
Along that line, why did you become a pâtissier?

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:25.230
Th-That's...

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:29.020
because I followed someone I loved to Paris...

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.960
and before I noticed...

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:45.150
Tooru, that was childish.

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:48.180
How can you snap at such a young boy?

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:49.580
My bad.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.550
Well, I like that about you.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.000
How long are you going to keep boxing?

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.340
I won't quit yet.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:10.590
I see.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:13.520
So I have to get rid of the child.

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.400
Are you sure?!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.610
Are you sure I can wear this?!

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.450
It's your first step to becoming a pâtissier.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.920
I went and bought it especially for you.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:34.450
Be grateful for it.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:36.790
Thank you, gramps.

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:40.970
Idol of the Ring, huh?

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.420
I think you'd do better selling cakes.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.910
No, I live to be Ono's apprentice.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:49.640
Sensei, please put me through the ringer!

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:52.270
You're courageous.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:55.470
I've never met such a courageous apprentice.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:14:00.050
My vision is falling apart...

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:43.020
Wow, this is amazing!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:45.970
Sensei, you're amazing!

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.030
This is art!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.740
I made a variety of cakes to Tachibana's order,

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:53.700
to add variety to the showcase.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.770
It's perfect.

00:14:55.770 --> 00:15:01.180
Except for the lack of a salesgirl, it's my perfect ideal of a shop!

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:02.880
Good afternoon.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.320
Welcome, Miss.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:08.510
But the grand opening is tomorrow.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.180
Yes, I'll come tomorrow as well.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.720
I just wanted to talk to Idol of the Ring-kun.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.240
Me?

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.150
I want to ask you one thing.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.200
What is it?

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.410
Why did you quit boxing?

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.470
I-I...

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:49.090
didn't mind losing my sight, if I could keep boxing.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:54.360
But if that happened, I couldn't see my opponent, so the match would be pointless.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:15.950
But...

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.060
One!

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:26.380
Two!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:28.410
Three!

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:29.790
Four!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.820
if I could box again,

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:35.380
I'd do whatever I had to.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:56.700
So you want to keep boxing.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.660
You're not finished yet.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:04.790
Thank you.

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:29.880
When I was a boxer, my boss bought me cakes when I won.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:31.940
That was great.

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:33.970
They were yummy.

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:40.870
Oh, but compared to your cakes, sensei, they were like pig-snot.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.790
But because they made you happy, they were good cakes.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:47.550
That's right.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:52.150
Nonetheless, your cakes are special.

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.210
They're the best!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.790
Yummy.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.560
Good work, Tooru.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.520
But I lost...

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.460
Yeah.

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:18.780
Namiko... I won't quit boxing.

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:24.400
I have to leave that gym, but I'll keep boxing.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:29.820
And... I'll take care of the baby when you're out.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:34.380
So please have the child!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:39.750
Then, you won't quit boxing for me.

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.420
I'm sorry.

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:25.620
What is it?

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.310
Did you want to ask something else?

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:33.310
No, I came here to buy a cake made by Kanda Eiji.

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:37.980
I'm still an apprentice,

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.820
so I can't make any yet.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:43.010
Then I don't mind waiting until you can.

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:44.950
I'll come and buy one when I win a match.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.300
Um... it's only one cake.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.600
Please take it with you, young lady.

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:56.130
That's...!

00:19:56.470 --> 00:20:00.090
That's great! I suddenly wanted to eat cake because I'm pregnant.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:02.550
Pregnant?

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:06.700
Yes. Our future child seems to like cake very much.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.160
Namiko. You...

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.620
It's for you. I'll bear it for you.

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:24.900
Cakes are useful after all, eh?

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:31.290
You'll see. I'll be able to make a big wedding cake for you in the future.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.980
Okay. I'm looking forward for it.

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:52.730
That man and woman make a perfect picture.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.840
A-Are you insinuating something about me?

00:20:55.840 --> 00:21:00.710
No way... How could I say such a thing to a gifted pâtissier?

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:04.990
Oh? It seems that this situation has also touched an ex-world champion.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:08.120
I was going to eat that cake last!

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:09.640
That's what you were thinking about?

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.950
You wanted to eat more...

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:16.040
Eating is the best way to learn sensei's taste!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.050
And I only ate twenty of them!

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:18.960
You ate too much!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.920
Shut up! Stay back, gramps!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.910
What! Say that again!

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:27.160
Now, now. It's late, and you'll disturb the neighbors.
